    "detailed_description": "<i>Are you ready to become Dr. Alb's Prodigy? Embark on an epic journey in a post-apocalyptic universe, where you must aid the Doctor in battling invaders, rescuing stranded characters, and uncovering the root of the looming danger.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/049df79e5e8d4ef83d1d3f505119a4a9.avif?t=1753300611\" width=652 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Pixel art with modern visual effects<br></li><li> Turn based and real time action<br></li><li> Unique roguelike runs</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combining retro visuals with cinematic lighting</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/e59246f7639ff0d42de7606bab4e5977.poster.avif?t=1753300611\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/e59246f7639ff0d42de7606bab4e5977.webm?t=1753300611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/e59246f7639ff0d42de7606bab4e5977.mp4?t=1753300611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Pixel graphics set within a 3D environment featuring cool lighting and impressive<br>visual effects.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multi-layered combat system</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/f01d28fd949b0aa064feffe7478f038a.poster.avif?t=1753300611\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/f01d28fd949b0aa064feffe7478f038a.webm?t=1753300611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/f01d28fd949b0aa064feffe7478f038a.mp4?t=1753300611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The combat system blends turn-based and real-time mechanics, depending on<br>enemy encounters and your damage capabilities.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Quests and intriguing characters to meet</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/aa8ea1d15c382af699ada4952c5df23b.poster.avif?t=1753300611\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/aa8ea1d15c382af699ada4952c5df23b.webm?t=1753300611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/aa8ea1d15c382af699ada4952c5df23b.mp4?t=1753300611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You'll engage with diverse NPCs and have the opportunity to undertake various<br>side missions.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike elements and procedural generation</strong></h2>Embark on unique roguelike runs featuring randomized levels and elements, as you<br>enhance your character with unique loot and abilities.",
    "about_the_game": "<i>Are you ready to become Dr. Alb's Prodigy? Embark on an epic journey in a post-apocalyptic universe, where you must aid the Doctor in battling invaders, rescuing stranded characters, and uncovering the root of the looming danger.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/049df79e5e8d4ef83d1d3f505119a4a9.avif?t=1753300611\" width=652 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Pixel art with modern visual effects<br></li><li> Turn based and real time action<br></li><li> Unique roguelike runs</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combining retro visuals with cinematic lighting</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/e59246f7639ff0d42de7606bab4e5977.poster.avif?t=1753300611\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/e59246f7639ff0d42de7606bab4e5977.webm?t=1753300611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/e59246f7639ff0d42de7606bab4e5977.mp4?t=1753300611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Pixel graphics set within a 3D environment featuring cool lighting and impressive<br>visual effects.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multi-layered combat system</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/f01d28fd949b0aa064feffe7478f038a.poster.avif?t=1753300611\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/f01d28fd949b0aa064feffe7478f038a.webm?t=1753300611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/f01d28fd949b0aa064feffe7478f038a.mp4?t=1753300611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The combat system blends turn-based and real-time mechanics, depending on<br>enemy encounters and your damage capabilities.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Quests and intriguing characters to meet</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/aa8ea1d15c382af699ada4952c5df23b.poster.avif?t=1753300611\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/aa8ea1d15c382af699ada4952c5df23b.webm?t=1753300611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727890/extras/aa8ea1d15c382af699ada4952c5df23b.mp4?t=1753300611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You'll engage with diverse NPCs and have the opportunity to undertake various<br>side missions.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike elements and procedural generation</strong></h2>Embark on unique roguelike runs featuring randomized levels and elements, as you<br>enhance your character with unique loot and abilities.",
